      "message": "I was suggesting adding reference to the spec:\n6.4.4.3.6 Attention - The Attention Command May be used by the Initiator to notify the Responder that it requires service. The value in the Object Position field Shall indicate to which Mode in the Discover Modes Command the VDO refers (see Figure 6-20) and Shall have been used previously in an Enter Mode Command request for an Active Mode.\"\nSince we have not Entered any mode, ignore any Attention packets received at this stage. In addition we can check for value of 000b or 111b in object position field and then ignore it.",
